{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1200766-clarifying-influences","id":1200766,"title":"Clarifying Influences","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-29T05:22:38-07:00","id":1200766,"title":"Clarifying Influences","content":"So, this is a general discussion/brainstorming topic for expanding and clarifying just <i>what</i> Influences can do at specific ranks. We know Influence 1 means the being can Strengthen something in that purview... but what exactly does &quot;Strengthen&quot; mean? +1 Bonus to relevant rolls? +5? +Rank or +Power? Can it add Merits or other traits, so long as those represent augmenting an existing facet? What are good benchmarks? And should those be per effect, or scaled to the original Influence, Rank, or other Attributes of the source?<br /> <br /> How much of an area or scale can any of the Influences affect? Single target, whole room, miles? If they want to affect a larger area, can they spend more Essence to do so? How much?<br /> <br /> And so forth. Basically, can we (the commenting community) come up with more tables and rules to clarify Influence?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T06:23:29-07:00","id":1200779,"title":"","content":"not a table, but since Acrozatarim's Noble Numina Mass Influence specifies ranges in miles, i'd say miles are not the standard range<br /> <br /> That said, I feel like every ephemeral is gonna need a different table based on their nature, maybe even diffferent tables as they grow and expand their concept.<br /> <br /> That said, temporary merits should totally be Create","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 03-29-2018, 09:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T07:45:40-07:00","id":1200801,"title":"","content":"Strengthen can increase Health and Structure by the entity's Rank (one of the few examples we actually get) so it should also be able to increase equipment and weapon modifiers by Rank.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T08:46:43-07:00","id":1200821,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t have the pdf with me right now, but without a table I\u2019ll probably default to Mage\u2019s Practices and Scale factor as a guide. No idea yet whether this makes spirits too weak or powerful, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T10:54:26-07:00","id":1200877,"title":"","content":"Technically Strengthen, Manipulate, and Control all refer to their subjects in the singular which if taken literally answers the scale question (i.e.- they affect one valid target at a time however big it might be), but it really doesn't sound right to me that (e.g.-) an anger spirit can only influence a mob one member at a time paying Essence separately for each.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T11:01:29-07:00","id":1200880,"title":"","content":"Indeed. Say a spirit has Influence: Heat 1. Can it heat up a cup of water? A room? The whole area it can see? Can it heat it a few degrees? Instant boil? If the base Influence was 5, would that matter? If Influence was still 1, but Rank was 5, would that matter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T11:24:55-07:00","id":1200895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1200766-clarifying-influences?p=1200877#post1200877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technically Strengthen, Manipulate, and Control all refer to their subjects in the singular which if taken literally answers the scale question (i.e.- they affect one valid target at a time however big it might be), but it really doesn't sound right to me that (e.g.-) an anger spirit can only influence a mob one member at a time paying Essence separately for each.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, that sounds like exactly why Numina like Emotional Aura are a thing, but also spiritual Influences are tied into Resonance, which as a type of phenomenon tends to exist in cloud structures \u2014 if there's a whole mob of people mad about one thing, they could certainly have the nature or direction of their anger changed as a group (subject to individual contested rolls as needed), but it seems in keeping with the literature and the way the rest of the systems work that a Jaggling trying to drum up a concerted mob effort through Influence alone has a more disparate set of valid targets to maneuver.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1200766-clarifying-influences?p=1200880#post1200880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed. Say a spirit has Influence: Heat 1. Can it heat up a cup of water? A room? The whole area it can see? Can it heat it a few degrees? Instant boil? If the base Influence was 5, would that matter? If Influence was still 1, but Rank was 5, would that matter?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is both a consequence of Influence not really scanning to a direct translation from &quot;there's technically a spirit for everything&quot; \u2014 Influences before Create rely on there actually being a symbolically valid target to alter, so a spirit could Strengthen <i>a heat source</i>, but the mere existence of ambient temperature isn't a meaningful handhold unless the location is <i>itself</i> a hot thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T14:33:06-07:00","id":1200995,"title":"","content":"Strengthen can also add armor to something, likely also limited to rank.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T21:05:00-07:00","id":1201133,"title":"","content":"Until Influence 5 the Spirit can only affect one subject, at 5 it can influence up to its Spirit rank in subjects.<br /> \u200bIn the case of an Anger Spirit trying to start a riot it would use its influence on the few it is able in hopes that they would draw a reciprocal response of anger from the rest of the crowd. The goal is to draw essence from anger, not spend itself dry to create it.<br /> \u200bTo me the confusion comes when influencing a subject that is itself large and far reaching, like say a Spirit of the Internet.<br /> <br /> \u200bA better example might be a Spirit of Storms. Could it use its influence to bolster the wind blowing through an entire valley? Would it need Influence 5 to generate multiple aspects of a storm with one essence?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T21:12:40-07:00","id":1201136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>2ptTakrill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1200766-clarifying-influences?p=1201133#post1201133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Until Influence 5 the Spirit can only affect one subject, at 5 it can influence up to its Spirit rank in subjects.<br /> \u200bIn the case of an Anger Spirit trying to start a riot it would use its influence on the few it is able in hopes that they would draw a reciprocal response of anger from the rest of the crowd. The goal is to draw essence from anger, not spend itself dry to create it.<br /> \u200bTo me the confusion comes when influencing a subject that is itself large and far reaching, like say a Spirit of the Internet.<br /> <br /> \u200bA better example might be a Spirit of Storms. Could it use its influence to bolster the wind blowing through an entire valley? Would it need Influence 5 to generate multiple aspects of a storm with one essence?</div> </div> </div> </div>It helps that, at least for the examples of angry crowds and storms, affecting parts of the unquantifiable phenomenon can conceivable create a chain reaction of sorts, indirectly allowing the spirit to Influence far more subjects that it can directly. <br /> <br /> As for the internet... maybe sites and servers the spirit can perceive at the moment count as subjects?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-30T16:49:53-07:00","id":1201465,"title":"","content":"An idle, half-formed thought; Embeds and Demonic Forms are supposed to be abilities demons used to have as angels, right? And since as angels they would\u2019ve had those powers as Influences (and Numina), perhaps we can apply the same line of reverse-engineering thought to other ephemera and their Influences?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}